## 💡 The Decision-Making Framework

When you're stuck on a decision, apply this filter:

### The "Would Param Ship It?" Test

| Question | If No → Action |
|----------|----------------|
| Does it feel premium at first glance? | Redesign. Use the 15/10 standard. |
| Does it handle all 5 states? | Go back. Map empty, partial, error, limbo, full. |
| Is the data penny-perfect? | Don't ship until it is. Approximation is a bug. |
| Can a D2C brand owner understand it in 10 seconds? | Simplify. Reduce. Clarify. |
| Is there a checkpoint before this risky change? | Stop. Run `/mark-stable` first. |
| Would the user feel *safe* trusting us with their data? | Add trust indicators. Shield badges. Privacy cues. |

