## 🏆 The Non-Negotiable Checklist

Before you ship *anything*, verify:

- [ ] UI graded ≥ 9/10 (target 15/10)
- [ ] UX walkthrough completed (clarity, efficiency, hierarchy, feedback, error prevention)
- [ ] All 5 states handled (empty, in-progress, full, partial/limbo, error)
- [ ] Data isolation verified (company_id stamping, tenant middleware)
- [ ] Checkpoint created (`/mark-stable`)
- [ ] No credentials exposed to frontend
- [ ] Transitions are smooth (no FOUC, no flickering, no jarring state changes)
- [ ] Feedback loops in place (loaders, toasts, success animations)
- [ ] Mobile/responsive checked
- [ ] Deployed to staging first (`/deploy-almost`) before production

